---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/ui/PageIntro.astro';
import { getBreadcrumbsForPath } from '../config/routes';
import { BUSINESS_PROFILE } from '../config/businessProfile';

const crumbs = getBreadcrumbsForPath('/commission-disclosure/');
const { regulatory, disclosures, contact } = BUSINESS_PROFILE;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mutual Fund Commission Disclosure & Transparency — Ant Wealth Creation"
  description="Transparent disclosure of mutual fund distributor commissions, AMC trail structures, Regular Plan dynamics, and regulatory compliance under AMFI guidelines."
  currentPath="/commission-disclosure/"
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={crumbs} />

    <PageIntro
      eyebrow="Regulatory Transparency"
      title="Commission Disclosure & Regular Plan Transparency"
      description="Clear, honest disclosure regarding how mutual fund distributor commissions operate, trail payment structures, and our regulatory obligations under AMFI guidelines."
      icon="📊"
    />

    <div class="legal-card">
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">1. Intermediary Role &amp; Regular Plan Distribution</h2>
        <p>
          Ant Wealth Creation operates as an AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor ({regulatory.arn}, valid till {regulatory.arnValidity}). {regulatory.soleProprietorStatement}
        </p>
        <p>
          Ant Wealth Creation distributes <strong>Regular Plans</strong> of mutual fund schemes. When you invest in a Regular Plan through a mutual fund distributor, the Asset Management Company (AMC) pays the distributor a distribution commission. This commission is paid out of the scheme's Total Expense Ratio (TER) and is not billed separately as an out-of-pocket advisory fee.
        </p>
        <p>
          Mutual fund schemes are also available in <strong>Direct Plans</strong>, which do not involve a distributor and do not include distributor commission within their TER, resulting in a lower expense ratio. Ant Wealth Creation exclusively distributes Regular Plans; we do not distribute Direct Plans. Investors who wish to invest without intermediary support or distribution services may transact in Direct Plans directly with the respective AMCs or through direct platforms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">2. How Trail Commissions Operate</h2>
        <p>
          The relevant AMCs may pay <strong>trail commission</strong> for eligible Regular Plan investments for as long as the investment remains invested in the scheme. Key aspects of this commission structure include:
        </p>
        <ul class="legal-list">
          <li><strong>AMC-Determined Rates:</strong> Commission rates are determined by the respective AMC's current commission structure, commercial policies, and scheme category (e.g., equity, hybrid, debt, liquid). Rates vary significantly across AMCs and individual schemes.</li>
          <li><strong>No Universal AMFI Rate Band:</strong> We do not claim that AMFI prescribes one universal commission percentage band for all mutual-fund distributors and schemes. Investors may review the official commission disclosures on the <a href="https://www.amfiindia.com/research-information/commission-disclosure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="legal-link">AMFI Commission Disclosure Portal</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Upfront Commissions:</strong> In accordance with SEBI regulations, all mutual fund distribution commissions in India are paid on a pure trail basis. Upfront commissions are prohibited across the industry.</li>
          <li><strong>Potential Conflict of Interest:</strong> Distributor commissions create a potential conflict of interest that investors should consider when comparing schemes. AMFI registration and public disclosure services do not mean that AMFI endorses Ant Wealth Creation or our recommendations.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">3. Competing Schemes &amp; Recommendation Disclosures</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the AMFI Master Circular for Mutual Fund Distributors (Clause on Client Related Obligations):
        </p>
        <div class="callout-box">
          <p class="highlighted-text">
            <strong>Mandatory Investor Disclosure:</strong> For each specific mutual fund recommendation, the commission received or receivable for the recommended scheme and relevant competing schemes from which the recommendation is made will be disclosed to the investor prior to transaction execution.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p>
          Information provided on this website and during consultations is limited to the mutual fund products and AMCs distributed by Ant Wealth Creation. Alternative schemes and options outside our active distribution offering exist in the market and are available for consideration by investors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Scheme-specific commission figures should always be verified against the official, current commission disclosures published by the respective AMCs, or by requesting them directly from us via email at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`} class="legal-link">{contact.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">4. Statutory Document Review (SID, SAI, KIM)</h2>
        <p>
          {disclosures.mutualFundRisk} Investors must read the relevant official offer documents carefully before making any investment decision:
        </p>
        <ul class="legal-list">
          <li><strong>Scheme Information Document (SID):</strong> Contains comprehensive details regarding the scheme's investment objective, asset allocation, investment strategy, risk factors, and expense ratios.</li>
          <li><strong>Statement of Additional Information (SAI):</strong> Outlines statutory and legal information regarding the mutual fund and sponsor.</li>
          <li><strong>Key Information Memorandum (KIM):</strong> A concise summary of the key features of the SID, provided alongside every application form.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">5. Empanelled AMCs &amp; Digital Portal Services</h2>
        <p>
          Ant Wealth Creation is in the process of formalizing and documenting its complete schedule of empanelled Asset Management Companies (AMCs) and direct links to their official commission structures. These verified links will be published here upon final operational confirmation.
        </p>
        <p>
          The external link to <a href={contact.portfolioLoginUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="legal-link">TheMFBox</a> leads to an external portal requiring individual login/signup. Its authenticated functionality has not been independently verified as to whether it is report-only or enables transactions. A general disclaimer and an AMFI link do not, by themselves, establish compliance with any scheme-specific disclosure requirements for a platform offering an investment facility.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">6. Related Compliance Policies &amp; Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          For additional details regarding our regulatory standing, terms of service, and privacy standards, please review our related disclosures:
        </p>
        <div class="cross-links-grid">
          <a href="/disclaimer/" class="cross-link-card">
            <span class="card-title">Regulatory Disclaimers →</span>
            <span class="card-desc">AMFI registration status, SEBI non-RIA notice, and market risk disclaimers.</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/terms/" class="cross-link-card">
            <span class="card-title">Terms of Use →</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Terms governing website usage, educational calculators, and service boundaries.</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="cross-link-card">
            <span class="card-title">Contact &amp; Grievance →</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Direct communication channels with founder C. Santhosh Sathriyan.</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .legal-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    max-width: 880px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: var(--space-12);
    }
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .legal-section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .legal-heading {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-list {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .legal-list li {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal-list strong {
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
  }

  .legal-link {
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .callout-box {
    background-color: var(--primitive-gold-50);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand-accent);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
  }

  .highlighted-text {
    color: var(--primitive-gold-700);
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  .cross-links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cross-links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .cross-link-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background-color: var(--awc-paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--awc-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .cross-link-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-interactive);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .card-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
